CRISTEL ESCOTO posted a new assignment in English (Anglo-American  
Literature) 9-Einstein <https://classroom.google.com/c/MTkwMzg2ODI2MTg1>.

Due: Feb 16
Reader's Theater Group
Read the guidelines on how to conduct Reader's Theater. For your activity  
today, conduct a meeting with your groupmates and decide on the following:

(1) Leader of the Group
(2) Literary Piece (you can adapt or create your own text)
(3) Role or Task of individual members

Note: Your reader's theater performance should not be less than 10 minutes  
and greater than 15 minutes. You can use zoom or google meet for your  
recording.
